622
00:34:17.226 --> 00:34:19.260
<i>Nothing? A stray hair?</i>

623
00:34:19.262 --> 00:34:21.395
<i>A drop of blood?
Nothing at all?</i>

624
00:34:21.397 --> 00:34:22.763
<i>Look at this.</i>

