677
00:37:03.326 --> 00:37:05.993
But it was after this that
the change came over Mike.

678
00:37:05.995 --> 00:37:08.462
No, before.

679
00:37:08.464 --> 00:37:09.997
At least six months.

680
00:37:09.999 --> 00:37:12.399
<i>For Mike to say that to his dad,</i>

681
