683
00:37:24.213 --> 00:37:26.313
<i>I just tried to keep him
talking long enough</i>

684
00:37:26.315 --> 00:37:28.415
<i>for the jury to catch on.</i>

685
00:37:31.052 --> 00:37:33.320
Alexander,
did you ever see Boone

