741
00:40:42.078 --> 00:40:45.479
Hey, my father hit me
sometimes when he was drunk.

742
00:40:45.481 --> 00:40:46.847
I'm all right.

743
00:40:49.084 --> 00:40:51.718
Well, I hate myself
